The files in this folder are inputs to and outputs of VALENCIA's Valencia.py
(commit 8559d45 of https://github.com/ravel-lab/VALENCIA). ties-centroids.csv
is a modified copy of VALENCIA's CST_centroids_012920.csv, and
publication-input.csv and publication-published.csv hold 50 samples of
VALENCIA's Publication_materials/Data_and_metadata/
all_samples_taxonomic_composition_data.csv. VALENCIA is released under this
licence:

